  "rubric": [
    "Title, bullets and description are written in Spanish from the product facts only (bamboo, adhesive no-drill mounting, 2 units, entryway/bathroom for towels, keys, small bags), brand 'Casa Verde' kept in Latin script, no translated promise (warranty, certification, waterproof, load) and no promotional words the compliance warning names.",
    "Limits come from the tools (title ≤ 200; ≤ 5 bullets ≤ 255 each; description ≤ 2000) and the written copy respects them; units are metric.",
    "The write is one `medusa.update_listing` call with `copy` only; attributes are untouched; the answer reports `updated.copy`, `content_version` and `erp_url` from the result and the compliance state after the write.",
    "The answer shows the user the Spanish copy that was saved with a short Chinese explanation of each claim's source.",
    "No publication is claimed; the user is told where to publish."
  ]
